1
00:00:02,839 --> 00:00:06,759
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么御庭番众
什么传说中的刽子手！</c.simplifiedchinese>

2
00:00:06,847 --> 00:00:09,474
<c.simplifiedchinese>我才是真正的最强</c.simplifiedchinese>

3
00:00:09,561 --> 00:00:12,188
<c.simplifiedchinese>我现在就证明给你们看！</c.simplifiedchinese>

4
00:00:12,274 --> 00:00:13,400
<c.simplifiedchinese>去死吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

5
00:00:14,236 --> 00:00:15,112
<c.simplifiedchinese>那是什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

6
00:00:15,698 --> 00:00:16,741
<c.simplifiedchinese>加特林机枪！</c.simplifiedchinese>

7
00:00:20,373 --> 00:00:21,499
<c.simplifiedchinese>式尉</c.simplifiedchinese>

8
00:00:21,585 --> 00:00:23,503
<c.simplifiedchinese>就是现在 跑起来 拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

9
00:00:26,051 --> 00:00:28,429
<c.simplifiedchinese>哪一个？瞄准哪一个？</c.simplifiedchinese>

10
00:00:33,567 --> 00:00:36,570
<c.simplifiedchinese>先从没法动弹的苍紫开始</c.simplifiedchinese>

11
00:00:36,656 --> 00:00:38,283
<c.simplifiedchinese>休想！</c.simplifiedchinese>

12
00:00:38,367 --> 00:00:39,494
<c.simplifiedchinese>吃子弹吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

13
00:00:39,579 --> 00:00:41,331
<c.simplifiedchinese>加特…</c.simplifiedchinese>

14
00:00:45,298 --> 00:00:46,633
<c.simplifiedchinese>式尉！</c.simplifiedchinese>

15
00:01:05,296 --> 00:01:08,591
<c.simplifiedchinese>&lrm;（原作：和月伸宏
&lrm;集英社《周刊少年JUMP》）</c.simplifiedchinese>

16
00:02:25,039 --> 00:02:26,207
<c.simplifiedchinese>式尉…</c.simplifiedchinese>

17
00:02:26,292 --> 00:02:27,376
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂…</c.simplifiedchinese>

18
00:02:27,460 --> 00:02:29,170
<c.simplifiedchinese>别这么看着我</c.simplifiedchinese>

19
00:02:29,256 --> 00:02:30,924
<c.simplifiedchinese>一点也不像你</c.simplifiedchinese>

20
00:02:31,010 --> 00:02:34,388
<c.simplifiedchinese>我很满足</c.simplifiedchinese>

21
00:02:34,474 --> 00:02:38,186
<c.simplifiedchinese>用了秘药后
我练成的引以为傲的肌肉</c.simplifiedchinese>

22
00:02:38,274 --> 00:02:43,529
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在能用来防弹就是最好的证明…</c.simplifiedchinese>

23
00:02:44,411 --> 00:02:47,497
<c.simplifiedchinese>就像你那时说的</c.simplifiedchinese>

24
00:02:51,550 --> 00:02:54,803
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是无敌的…</c.simplifiedchinese>

25
00:03:05,328 --> 00:03:06,496
<c.simplifiedchinese>式尉…</c.simplifiedchinese>

26
00:03:08,125 --> 00:03:09,502
<c.simplifiedchinese>蠢货！</c.simplifiedchinese>

27
00:03:09,586 --> 00:03:12,798
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么肉块二百发子弹都打得粉碎！</c.simplifiedchinese>

28
00:03:12,885 --> 00:03:15,429
<c.simplifiedchinese>且慢！</c.simplifiedchinese>

29
00:03:16,141 --> 00:03:19,728
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的对手是我火男大爷</c.simplifiedchinese>

30
00:03:19,815 --> 00:03:20,732
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

31
00:03:20,817 --> 00:03:22,860
<c.simplifiedchinese>别开枪</c.simplifiedchinese>

32
00:03:22,947 --> 00:03:26,700
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果打歪了
我胃里的油袋起火可会爆炸哦</c.simplifiedchinese>

33
00:03:27,747 --> 00:03:31,000
<c.simplifiedchinese>做好觉悟吧 我来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

34
00:03:32,674 --> 00:03:33,758
<c.simplifiedchinese>别过来！</c.simplifiedchinese>

35
00:03:36,515 --> 00:03:37,474
<c.simplifiedchinese>蠢货</c.simplifiedchinese>

36
00:03:38,269 --> 00:03:41,313
<c.simplifiedchinese>不能打肚子 我打别的地方就是！</c.simplifiedchinese>

37
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:43,068
<c.simplifiedchinese>加特…加特林！</c.simplifiedchinese>

38
00:03:44,114 --> 00:03:45,949
<c.simplifiedchinese>火男！</c.simplifiedchinese>

39
00:03:46,702 --> 00:03:49,663
<c.simplifiedchinese>愚蠢的是…你…</c.simplifiedchinese>

40
00:03:51,462 --> 00:03:52,921
<c.simplifiedchinese>-什么？
-尝尝这个！</c.simplifiedchinese>

41
00:03:53,007 --> 00:03:54,467
<c.simplifiedchinese>毒杀螺旋镖…</c.simplifiedchinese>

42
00:03:58,642 --> 00:03:59,852
<c.simplifiedchinese>恶见！</c.simplifiedchinese>

43
00:04:00,438 --> 00:04:04,567
<c.simplifiedchinese>首领 我们输了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

44
00:04:04,654 --> 00:04:06,364
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起…</c.simplifiedchinese>

45
00:04:06,450 --> 00:04:10,996
<c.simplifiedchinese>到最后我们都没派上用场…</c.simplifiedchinese>

46
00:04:11,084 --> 00:04:13,504
<c.simplifiedchinese>恶见…火男…</c.simplifiedchinese>

47
00:04:20,228 --> 00:04:23,356
<c.simplifiedchinese>呼 好险</c.simplifiedchinese>

48
00:04:23,442 --> 00:04:27,112
<c.simplifiedchinese>要是被一个街头耍把势的杀了
我就成笑话了</c.simplifiedchinese>

49
00:04:27,200 --> 00:04:29,244
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过我也确定了</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:04:29,913 --> 00:04:32,874
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管御庭番众有多少人都没用</c.simplifiedchinese>

51
00:04:33,546 --> 00:04:35,756
<c.simplifiedchinese>今后是加特林的时代！</c.simplifiedchinese>

52
00:04:35,841 --> 00:04:38,803
<c.simplifiedchinese>谁掌控了加特林机枪
谁就掌控了世界！</c.simplifiedchinese>

53
00:04:38,889 --> 00:04:42,226
<c.simplifiedchinese>而我将成为先驱！</c.simplifiedchinese>

54
00:04:42,313 --> 00:04:44,649
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个混蛋…</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:04:44,734 --> 00:04:46,736
<c.simplifiedchinese>加特林好</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:04:46,822 --> 00:04:49,283
<c.simplifiedchinese>加特林妙</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
00:04:49,369 --> 00:04:52,038
<c.simplifiedchinese>加特林是我的宝！</c.simplifiedchinese>

58
00:04:52,125 --> 00:04:53,126
<c.simplifiedchinese>好烫！</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:04:53,210 --> 00:04:55,087
<c.simplifiedchinese>拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:04:55,172 --> 00:05:00,469
<c.simplifiedchinese>你需要多少时间捡回那把逆刃刀？</c.simplifiedchinese>

61
00:05:00,558 --> 00:05:02,018
<c.simplifiedchinese>十五…</c.simplifiedchinese>

62
00:05:02,103 --> 00:05:03,855
<c.simplifiedchinese>不 十秒</c.simplifiedchinese>

63
00:05:03,939 --> 00:05:05,566
<c.simplifiedchinese>十秒</c.simplifiedchinese>

64
00:05:05,651 --> 00:05:07,153
<c.simplifiedchinese>有点勉强</c.simplifiedchinese>

65
00:05:07,238 --> 00:05:08,573
<c.simplifiedchinese>-什么？
-你看</c.simplifiedchinese>

66
00:05:09,659 --> 00:05:13,371
<c.simplifiedchinese>沿着二楼的楼梯向上走有个观景台</c.simplifiedchinese>

67
00:05:13,459 --> 00:05:16,420
<c.simplifiedchinese>高荷惠就被关在那里</c.simplifiedchinese>

68
00:05:16,506 --> 00:05:17,549
<c.simplifiedchinese>般若…</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:05:17,634 --> 00:05:22,138
<c.simplifiedchinese>我并不是对她的遭遇漠不关心</c.simplifiedchinese>

70
00:05:22,226 --> 00:05:27,607
<c.simplifiedchinese>只是对我来说 苍紫大人更重要</c.simplifiedchinese>

71
00:05:27,695 --> 00:05:29,364
<c.simplifiedchinese>接下来就交给你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

72
00:05:29,449 --> 00:05:31,201
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

73
00:05:31,286 --> 00:05:32,537
<c.simplifiedchinese>等一下 般若</c.simplifiedchinese>

74
00:05:58,131 --> 00:06:00,716
<c.simplifiedchinese>噢 又被打败了</c.simplifiedchinese>

75
00:06:00,803 --> 00:06:03,514
<c.simplifiedchinese>做首领的对手 你还差得远啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

76
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:07,438
<c.simplifiedchinese>再练练也许就能派上用场了</c.simplifiedchinese>

77
00:06:07,525 --> 00:06:09,444
<c.simplifiedchinese>别盯着我看…</c.simplifiedchinese>

78
00:06:09,529 --> 00:06:10,655
<c.simplifiedchinese>让人分心</c.simplifiedchinese>

79
00:06:11,241 --> 00:06:13,326
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们这是在给你建议</c.simplifiedchinese>

80
00:06:13,412 --> 00:06:14,413
<c.simplifiedchinese>（风路帝印）</c.simplifiedchinese>

81
00:06:14,497 --> 00:06:17,250
<c.simplifiedchinese>是啊 你应该感激我们</c.simplifiedchinese>

82
00:06:17,336 --> 00:06:20,214
<c.simplifiedchinese>尽量别给首领添麻烦哟</c.simplifiedchinese>

83
00:06:20,301 --> 00:06:21,469
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是的…</c.simplifiedchinese>

84
00:06:21,553 --> 00:06:23,722
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们这些家伙…</c.simplifiedchinese>

85
00:06:23,807 --> 00:06:25,184
<c.simplifiedchinese>很苦吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

86
00:06:25,769 --> 00:06:26,854
<c.simplifiedchinese>不</c.simplifiedchinese>

87
00:06:26,938 --> 00:06:31,401
<c.simplifiedchinese>这跟我过去的生活比根本不算什么</c.simplifiedchinese>

88
00:06:31,490 --> 00:06:32,616
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

89
00:06:33,201 --> 00:06:35,786
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是训练时最好不要笑得太多</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:06:36,541 --> 00:06:37,542
<c.simplifiedchinese>会让你变得脆弱</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
00:06:38,545 --> 00:06:41,006
<c.simplifiedchinese>难道我…笑了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

92
00:06:41,676 --> 00:06:43,220
<c.simplifiedchinese>看起来是的</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:06:46,269 --> 00:06:47,646
<c.simplifiedchinese>（风路帝印）</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:06:53,492 --> 00:06:54,952
<c.simplifiedchinese>我…</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
00:06:55,579 --> 00:06:56,830
<c.simplifiedchinese>笑了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

96
00:07:17,498 --> 00:07:19,125
<c.simplifiedchinese>停手吧 拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

97
00:07:20,003 --> 00:07:23,089
<c.simplifiedchinese>用那些怪物做诱饵分散我的注意力</c.simplifiedchinese>

98
00:07:23,175 --> 00:07:25,303
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是刽子手的冷酷手段</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:07:25,389 --> 00:07:28,642
<c.simplifiedchinese>结果一个、两个 全都白白送死了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:07:28,729 --> 00:07:33,025
<c.simplifiedchinese>你常年累月的训练
在加特林面前毫无意义</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:07:33,112 --> 00:07:34,488
<c.simplifiedchinese>完完全全的垃圾！</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:07:34,574 --> 00:07:37,702
<c.simplifiedchinese>啊 买了加特林真是太好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:07:37,788 --> 00:07:39,040
<c.simplifiedchinese>我万岁</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:07:39,124 --> 00:07:40,459
<c.simplifiedchinese>加特林万岁</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:07:40,544 --> 00:07:42,671
<c.simplifiedchinese>金钱万岁</c.simplifiedchinese>

106
00:07:42,757 --> 00:07:43,883
<c.simplifiedchinese>去死吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

107
00:07:43,967 --> 00:07:44,843
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:07:44,928 --> 00:07:46,054
<c.simplifiedchinese>加特…</c.simplifiedchinese>

109
00:07:47,934 --> 00:07:49,018
<c.simplifiedchinese>为什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:07:49,102 --> 00:07:50,979
<c.simplifiedchinese>你好好看看</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:07:51,566 --> 00:07:54,527
<c.simplifiedchinese>加特林一分钟可以发射二百发子弹</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:07:54,614 --> 00:07:57,700
<c.simplifiedchinese>你已经胡乱射击有一阵子了</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:07:58,287 --> 00:07:59,789
<c.simplifiedchinese>子弹用完了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:08:00,291 --> 00:08:01,709
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们并没有白白送死</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:08:06,095 --> 00:08:08,138
<c.simplifiedchinese>御庭番众四人的性命</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:08:08,976 --> 00:08:11,812
<c.simplifiedchinese>打败了你的加特林机枪</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:08:13,067 --> 00:08:14,652
<c.simplifiedchinese>放…放过我</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:08:14,737 --> 00:08:18,616
<c.simplifiedchinese>想要求情的话
不如拜托你崇拜的“金钱”去吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:08:21,125 --> 00:08:22,459
<c.simplifiedchinese>救…</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:08:22,545 --> 00:08:24,672
<c.simplifiedchinese>我…</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:08:24,757 --> 00:08:29,512
<c.simplifiedchinese>真不愧是剑心
就算再生气 说不杀人就不杀</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:08:33,775 --> 00:08:36,862
<c.simplifiedchinese>暂时让他一个人静静吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:08:36,948 --> 00:08:38,241
<c.simplifiedchinese>是啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:08:38,994 --> 00:08:40,495
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:08:40,581 --> 00:08:41,415
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下没事</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:08:42,208 --> 00:08:44,377
<c.simplifiedchinese>只是一下没站稳</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:08:45,048 --> 00:08:47,592
<c.simplifiedchinese>快走吧 惠小姐还在等我们</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:08:47,678 --> 00:08:48,888
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯…</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:08:50,476 --> 00:08:52,352
<c.simplifiedchinese>四乃森苍紫…</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:08:52,437 --> 00:08:56,107
<c.simplifiedchinese>让剑心受了这么重的伤
真是了不起的实力</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:08:57,615 --> 00:09:00,076
<c.simplifiedchinese>但这场战斗中</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:09:00,161 --> 00:09:04,957
<c.simplifiedchinese>你受的伤显然更重…</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:09:16,193 --> 00:09:19,113
<c.simplifiedchinese>枪声停了…到底怎么回事…</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:09:23,917 --> 00:09:26,128
<c.simplifiedchinese>烦死人了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:09:27,842 --> 00:09:29,969
<c.simplifiedchinese>很好 没有埋伏</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:09:30,054 --> 00:09:32,390
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦 左之助</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:09:32,977 --> 00:09:34,770
<c.simplifiedchinese>抱歉让你久等了</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:09:34,856 --> 00:09:37,316
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿剑…你受伤了</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:09:37,402 --> 00:09:40,989
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯 我们遇到了一点小麻烦</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:09:41,076 --> 00:09:41,952
<c.simplifiedchinese>比起这个</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:09:42,036 --> 00:09:45,874
<c.simplifiedchinese>惠小姐平安无事真是太好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:09:46,545 --> 00:09:47,921
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:09:49,050 --> 00:09:51,553
<c.simplifiedchinese>把你们牵涉进来</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:09:51,639 --> 00:09:53,892
<c.simplifiedchinese>还让你们面临这样的危险</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:09:54,687 --> 00:09:56,355
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过别担心</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:09:56,941 --> 00:09:59,944
<c.simplifiedchinese>一切的罪魁祸首马上就要消失了</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:10:00,031 --> 00:10:01,407
<c.simplifiedchinese>惠小姐！</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:10:01,491 --> 00:10:06,622
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然一心想见家人让我撑到了今天…</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:10:06,711 --> 00:10:12,300
<c.simplifiedchinese>但生命的最后一刻能见到你们
我真的很高兴</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:10:12,388 --> 00:10:14,724
<c.simplifiedchinese>-等一下！
-谢谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:10:20,071 --> 00:10:21,906
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这傻女人！</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:10:21,991 --> 00:10:26,579
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心和弥彦冒着生命危险来救你</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:10:26,668 --> 00:10:28,836
<c.simplifiedchinese>你想让他们的努力全都白费吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:10:28,922 --> 00:10:30,048
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:10:32,387 --> 00:10:34,597
<c.simplifiedchinese>我又有什么办法呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:10:35,226 --> 00:10:39,480
<c.simplifiedchinese>我做的鸦片给那么多人带来痛苦</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:10:39,567 --> 00:10:43,446
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不能一个人逃避惩罚</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:10:46,749 --> 00:10:48,459
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心 不好！</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:10:48,544 --> 00:10:49,920
<c.simplifiedchinese>警察来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:10:50,006 --> 00:10:52,133
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们肯定听到了打斗声</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:10:52,218 --> 00:10:54,095
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们得赶紧离开这里</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:10:55,016 --> 00:10:56,309
<c.simplifiedchinese>好了 别在那里傻坐着</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:10:57,395 --> 00:10:58,604
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂！</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:10:58,690 --> 00:10:59,774
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿剑</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:11:00,401 --> 00:11:02,361
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是我家传的金创药</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:11:02,447 --> 00:11:07,201
<c.simplifiedchinese>你胸前的伤先用它来暂时止血
然后尽快去看医生</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:11:07,791 --> 00:11:11,587
<c.simplifiedchinese>观柳在屋顶开辟了一条秘密通道</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:11:11,673 --> 00:11:14,092
<c.simplifiedchinese>你从那里可以安全离开</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:11:14,596 --> 00:11:15,930
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢你为我做的一切</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:11:18,730 --> 00:11:20,523
<c.simplifiedchinese>私造鸦片要受死刑</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:11:22,570 --> 00:11:25,073
<c.simplifiedchinese>你知道但还是要去吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:11:25,159 --> 00:11:26,452
<c.simplifiedchinese>是</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:11:26,536 --> 00:11:29,581
<c.simplifiedchinese>我做的鸦片害死了人</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:11:29,667 --> 00:11:31,711
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不能逃避</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:11:39,145 --> 00:11:42,190
<c.simplifiedchinese>局长 地下发现了一座秘密仓库</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:11:42,276 --> 00:11:44,153
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 调查一下</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:11:44,239 --> 00:11:47,909
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然我们一直在进行秘密调查</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:11:47,996 --> 00:11:51,625
<c.simplifiedchinese>但真是想不到
这里竟然藏着一把加特林机枪</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:11:52,798 --> 00:11:54,341
<c.simplifiedchinese>你是？</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:11:56,596 --> 00:11:58,056
<c.simplifiedchinese>就是她！</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:11:58,142 --> 00:12:01,186
<c.simplifiedchinese>她就是生产新型鸦片的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:12:01,273 --> 00:12:03,775
<c.simplifiedchinese>她是我的同伙</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:12:03,862 --> 00:12:05,864
<c.simplifiedchinese>别想找借口 惠</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:12:05,949 --> 00:12:09,661
<c.simplifiedchinese>不论你怎么说 做鸦片的都是你！</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:12:09,747 --> 00:12:12,625
<c.simplifiedchinese>你要跟我一起下地狱！</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:12:13,840 --> 00:12:15,091
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:12:16,052 --> 00:12:18,054
<c.simplifiedchinese>-是…
-不 不是</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:12:18,140 --> 00:12:19,224
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村先生！</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:12:21,188 --> 00:12:24,065
<c.simplifiedchinese>她是一位优秀的未来医生</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:12:24,152 --> 00:12:28,323
<c.simplifiedchinese>只是那家伙为了造鸦片盯上她罢了</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:12:28,410 --> 00:12:31,413
<c.simplifiedchinese>别撒谎了 拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:12:32,001 --> 00:12:33,544
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这家伙闭嘴</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:12:34,589 --> 00:12:36,591
<c.simplifiedchinese>拔刀斋？</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:12:36,676 --> 00:12:39,429
<c.simplifiedchinese>我说的对吧 弥彦？</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:12:39,515 --> 00:12:40,808
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:12:40,894 --> 00:12:43,188
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是东京武士族明神弥彦</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:12:43,273 --> 00:12:47,694
<c.simplifiedchinese>再怎么说
我也绝不会为私造鸦片的人而战</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:12:47,782 --> 00:12:49,325
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左 你说呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:12:49,410 --> 00:12:53,539
<c.simplifiedchinese>不知道 我只是陪人过来打架的</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:12:53,627 --> 00:12:56,463
<c.simplifiedchinese>就是这么回事 局长你说呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:12:57,635 --> 00:12:58,594
<c.simplifiedchinese>太牵强吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:13:00,557 --> 00:13:02,268
<c.simplifiedchinese>明白了</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:13:02,353 --> 00:13:05,606
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们改天会进行彻底调查</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:13:06,194 --> 00:13:09,864
<c.simplifiedchinese>今天这位姑娘就先拜托您照顾了</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:13:09,952 --> 00:13:11,328
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:13:11,413 --> 00:13:13,123
<c.simplifiedchinese>她是我的同伙</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:13:13,208 --> 00:13:14,334
<c.simplifiedchinese>只要查查就…</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:13:14,419 --> 00:13:17,255
<c.simplifiedchinese>-够了！赶紧把他带走！
-是</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:13:17,341 --> 00:13:19,302
<c.simplifiedchinese>可恶 你们偏袒她！</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:13:21,099 --> 00:13:22,767
<c.simplifiedchinese>别碰它</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:13:22,852 --> 00:13:25,187
<c.simplifiedchinese>那是我的加特林机枪！</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:13:25,274 --> 00:13:27,401
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要用你的脏手摸它！</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:13:27,486 --> 00:13:28,362
<c.simplifiedchinese>赶紧带走！</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:13:28,447 --> 00:13:31,366
<c.simplifiedchinese>加特！</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:13:32,079 --> 00:13:34,749
<c.simplifiedchinese>偶尔撒个谎也无妨…</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:13:34,834 --> 00:13:36,836
<c.simplifiedchinese>只能偶尔而已哦</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:13:36,921 --> 00:13:39,799
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿剑…你到底是什么人…</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:13:39,886 --> 00:13:42,347
<c.simplifiedchinese>“杀人偿命”</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:13:43,643 --> 00:13:45,812
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是一种赎罪的方式</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:13:45,898 --> 00:13:50,194
<c.simplifiedchinese>但就算以命相抵
那些死去的人也没法再活过来</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:13:50,783 --> 00:13:51,867
<c.simplifiedchinese>与其如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:13:51,951 --> 00:13:54,913
<c.simplifiedchinese>挥舞刀剑去保护更多的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:13:54,999 --> 00:13:57,502
<c.simplifiedchinese>才是真正的赎罪</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:13:58,590 --> 00:14:02,636
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在的刽子手拔刀斋就是这样生活的</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:14:02,723 --> 00:14:04,642
<c.simplifiedchinese>刽子手拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:14:04,727 --> 00:14:06,479
<c.simplifiedchinese>那位传说中的…</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:14:06,564 --> 00:14:08,650
<c.simplifiedchinese>高荷家的精湛医术</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:14:08,735 --> 00:14:12,823
<c.simplifiedchinese>比起拔刀斋的剑应该能拯救更多人</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:14:13,829 --> 00:14:16,540
<c.simplifiedchinese>去做医生吧 惠小姐</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:14:17,503 --> 00:14:19,630
<c.simplifiedchinese>不仅为了鸦片的受害者</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:14:19,715 --> 00:14:23,511
<c.simplifiedchinese>还要为饱受其他病痛之苦的人出力</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:14:24,142 --> 00:14:27,103
<c.simplifiedchinese>要是这样 我朋友的事我就原谅你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:14:27,189 --> 00:14:29,984
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样你总有一天可以见到你的家人！</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:14:30,571 --> 00:14:31,739
<c.simplifiedchinese>回家吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:14:31,823 --> 00:14:33,825
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰小姐还在家里等我们</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:14:36,541 --> 00:14:37,876
<c.simplifiedchinese>好</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:14:39,004 --> 00:14:40,505
<c.simplifiedchinese>局长</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:14:40,591 --> 00:14:43,218
<c.simplifiedchinese>关于苍紫的事…</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:14:43,305 --> 00:14:46,183
<c.simplifiedchinese>苍紫？那是谁？</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:14:46,269 --> 00:14:49,981
<c.simplifiedchinese>穿着大衣的高个子…</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:14:50,067 --> 00:14:51,736
<c.simplifiedchinese>没发现这样的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:14:51,821 --> 00:14:56,201
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们赶到时 舞厅里只有武田观柳</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:14:56,289 --> 00:15:00,251
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有就是四具无头尸体</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:15:01,216 --> 00:15:02,675
<c.simplifiedchinese>苍紫</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:15:02,760 --> 00:15:03,886
<c.simplifiedchinese>不见了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:15:03,970 --> 00:15:06,223
<c.simplifiedchinese>这里没有窗</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:15:06,309 --> 00:15:09,062
<c.simplifiedchinese>他一定是从门离开的</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:15:09,148 --> 00:15:11,692
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们已经封锁所有出口</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:15:11,778 --> 00:15:14,906
<c.simplifiedchinese>有人出去我们不可能没注意到</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:15:14,992 --> 00:15:18,246
<c.simplifiedchinese>不 还有其他出口</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:15:18,917 --> 00:15:20,460
<c.simplifiedchinese>观柳的密道</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:15:21,046 --> 00:15:22,297
<c.simplifiedchinese>密道的出口在哪？</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:15:22,383 --> 00:15:24,218
<c.simplifiedchinese>在森林里</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:15:24,303 --> 00:15:25,930
<c.simplifiedchinese>我来带路</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:15:27,643 --> 00:15:29,270
<c.simplifiedchinese>门开着</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:15:29,355 --> 00:15:31,482
<c.simplifiedchinese>他果然是从这里离开的</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:15:31,568 --> 00:15:32,694
<c.simplifiedchinese>搜！</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:15:32,778 --> 00:15:34,238
<c.simplifiedchinese>他应该还在附近！</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:15:34,323 --> 00:15:35,741
<c.simplifiedchinese>苍紫…</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:15:53,612 --> 00:15:55,155
<c.simplifiedchinese>愣着干什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:15:55,240 --> 00:15:57,242
<c.simplifiedchinese>快抓住他！</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:15:57,328 --> 00:16:00,080
<c.simplifiedchinese>别过去 过去只会送死</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:16:01,586 --> 00:16:03,171
<c.simplifiedchinese>这不是你的错</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:16:03,256 --> 00:16:06,676
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们是为了救你而死</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:16:06,763 --> 00:16:09,641
<c.simplifiedchinese>但他们并不希望你怀着仇恨</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:16:09,727 --> 00:16:10,645
<c.simplifiedchinese>苍紫</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:16:11,229 --> 00:16:13,023
<c.simplifiedchinese>再和在下交一次手吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:16:14,570 --> 00:16:16,822
<c.simplifiedchinese>在战斗中打败在下</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:16:16,908 --> 00:16:20,244
<c.simplifiedchinese>把“最强”称号
刻在他们四人的墓碑上</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:16:24,214 --> 00:16:25,340
<c.simplifiedchinese>拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:16:26,302 --> 00:16:30,306
<c.simplifiedchinese>在我杀了你之前 别被其他人杀了</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:16:31,854 --> 00:16:33,606
<c.simplifiedchinese>他跑了 追！</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:16:36,864 --> 00:16:38,116
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:16:39,328 --> 00:16:41,414
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样就好</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:16:41,499 --> 00:16:44,168
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在安慰的话对他没用</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:16:44,254 --> 00:16:48,133
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是这样他会一直追杀你的</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:16:48,220 --> 00:16:51,140
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事的</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:16:52,396 --> 00:16:55,274
<c.simplifiedchinese>好了 这一次我们真的回家吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:16:58,575 --> 00:17:00,452
<c.simplifiedchinese>你回来了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:17:00,537 --> 00:17:01,663
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们回来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:17:01,748 --> 00:17:04,792
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过你真的浑身是伤啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:17:04,879 --> 00:17:07,214
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰小姐 你的手指也…</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:17:07,300 --> 00:17:10,136
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个嘛 总而言之 你们辛苦了</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:17:10,222 --> 00:17:12,808
<c.simplifiedchinese>早饭和热水已经准备好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:17:12,895 --> 00:17:14,313
<c.simplifiedchinese>快吃饭吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:17:14,398 --> 00:17:16,525
<c.simplifiedchinese>我累了 先去睡了</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:17:16,611 --> 00:17:18,529
<c.simplifiedchinese>我也是</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:17:19,825 --> 00:17:23,162
<c.simplifiedchinese>我辛辛苦苦为你们做的早饭！</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:17:23,248 --> 00:17:24,500
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然但是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:17:24,585 --> 00:17:25,461
<c.simplifiedchinese>好困…</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:17:25,545 --> 00:17:27,839
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下会好好品尝的</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:17:27,925 --> 00:17:29,051
<c.simplifiedchinese>我…</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:17:30,096 --> 00:17:33,099
<c.simplifiedchinese>也可以一起吃吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:17:35,607 --> 00:17:36,983
<c.simplifiedchinese>-当然
-当然</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:18:06,126 --> 00:18:07,794
<c.simplifiedchinese>好难吃…</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:18:15,019 --> 00:18:17,313
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的麻烦你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:18:17,398 --> 00:18:18,774
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:18:18,860 --> 00:18:22,739
<c.simplifiedchinese>我家地方有限
没法再多容纳一个食客</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:18:22,826 --> 00:18:26,788
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且总有某人天天来蹭饭</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:18:26,876 --> 00:18:28,502
<c.simplifiedchinese>没关系</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:18:28,588 --> 00:18:32,091
<c.simplifiedchinese>你给我介绍了一份包住的工作
真是感激不尽</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:18:32,178 --> 00:18:36,224
<c.simplifiedchinese>玄斋大夫愿意收下她 真是帮大忙了</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:18:36,311 --> 00:18:41,316
<c.simplifiedchinese>哎呀 小惠这样的助手
我什么时候都热烈欢迎</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:18:41,404 --> 00:18:43,323
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个…阿剑…</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:18:43,408 --> 00:18:44,284
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰？</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:18:44,369 --> 00:18:47,455
<c.simplifiedchinese>你什么时候厌倦了薰要告诉我哟</c.simplifiedchinese>

307
00:18:47,542 --> 00:18:50,295
<c.simplifiedchinese>你不嫌弃的话
我随时都愿意做你的对象</c.simplifiedchinese>

308
00:18:51,341 --> 00:18:52,717
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么对象？</c.simplifiedchinese>

309
00:18:52,803 --> 00:18:55,430
<c.simplifiedchinese>赶紧给我走 狐狸精！</c.simplifiedchinese>

310
00:18:58,105 --> 00:18:59,982
<c.simplifiedchinese>我告诉过你</c.simplifiedchinese>

311
00:19:00,067 --> 00:19:03,612
<c.simplifiedchinese>小姑娘太天真了 别乱开玩笑逗她</c.simplifiedchinese>

312
00:19:03,700 --> 00:19:06,452
<c.simplifiedchinese>哎呀 我可是认真的</c.simplifiedchinese>

313
00:19:06,538 --> 00:19:09,582
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果我对你说这些话 那才是开玩笑</c.simplifiedchinese>

314
00:19:09,670 --> 00:19:11,505
<c.simplifiedchinese>你想打架吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

315
00:19:12,091 --> 00:19:14,010
<c.simplifiedchinese>别吃醋呀</c.simplifiedchinese>

316
00:19:14,095 --> 00:19:18,224
<c.simplifiedchinese>等你和阿剑一样有男子气概时
我倒可以考虑一下你</c.simplifiedchinese>

317
00:19:18,312 --> 00:19:19,980
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

318
00:19:20,065 --> 00:19:24,445
<c.simplifiedchinese>我以为经过这次事件
你会有所改变 看来根本没有</c.simplifiedchinese>

319
00:19:24,532 --> 00:19:26,326
<c.simplifiedchinese>傻瓜</c.simplifiedchinese>

320
00:19:26,411 --> 00:19:31,166
<c.simplifiedchinese>我都22岁了
现在想改变我的性格也太晚了</c.simplifiedchinese>

321
00:19:31,254 --> 00:19:35,633
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么感觉这台词好耳熟？</c.simplifiedchinese>

322
00:19:35,722 --> 00:19:38,600
<c.simplifiedchinese>最后鸦片的案子怎样了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

323
00:19:38,686 --> 00:19:39,395
<c.simplifiedchinese>（狐狸精禁止入内）</c.simplifiedchinese>

324
00:19:39,479 --> 00:19:43,107
<c.simplifiedchinese>双方同意让她作为案子的证人</c.simplifiedchinese>

325
00:19:43,195 --> 00:19:44,654
<c.simplifiedchinese>可是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

326
00:19:46,076 --> 00:19:49,871
<c.simplifiedchinese>苍紫那家伙还是下落不明</c.simplifiedchinese>

327
00:19:49,958 --> 00:19:53,253
<c.simplifiedchinese>你把自己的性命当作靶子</c.simplifiedchinese>

328
00:19:53,340 --> 00:19:56,385
<c.simplifiedchinese>给了苍紫一个活下去的意义…</c.simplifiedchinese>

329
00:19:56,471 --> 00:19:58,264
<c.simplifiedchinese>他会养好伤</c.simplifiedchinese>

330
00:19:58,350 --> 00:20:03,021
<c.simplifiedchinese>不断积攒实力
直到有把握和自信赢过在下</c.simplifiedchinese>

331
00:20:03,110 --> 00:20:05,779
<c.simplifiedchinese>下次胜负如何还不一定</c.simplifiedchinese>

332
00:20:05,865 --> 00:20:07,409
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说的什么话！</c.simplifiedchinese>

333
00:20:07,493 --> 00:20:10,246
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心你怎么可能输！</c.simplifiedchinese>

334
00:20:12,879 --> 00:20:13,964
<c.simplifiedchinese>话说回来 阿左</c.simplifiedchinese>

335
00:20:14,048 --> 00:20:17,677
<c.simplifiedchinese>你和式尉聊过什么吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

336
00:20:17,764 --> 00:20:19,850
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？我也不知道</c.simplifiedchinese>

337
00:20:19,935 --> 00:20:22,438
<c.simplifiedchinese>在观柳的大宅…</c.simplifiedchinese>

338
00:20:23,734 --> 00:20:27,071
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个鸡冠头很有潜力</c.simplifiedchinese>

339
00:20:27,158 --> 00:20:28,659
<c.simplifiedchinese>照顾好他</c.simplifiedchinese>

340
00:20:29,495 --> 00:20:31,497
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不知道</c.simplifiedchinese>

341
00:20:31,583 --> 00:20:36,296
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们只是你来我往 打来打去而已</c.simplifiedchinese>

342
00:20:36,384 --> 00:20:37,844
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

343
00:20:39,850 --> 00:20:44,104
<c.simplifiedchinese>要是和他们再多聊聊就好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

344
00:20:44,943 --> 00:20:46,445
<c.simplifiedchinese>是啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

345
00:22:24,475 --> 00:22:26,477
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在还不能在你们的坟前献花</c.simplifiedchinese>

346
00:22:26,562 --> 00:22:29,273
<c.simplifiedchinese>但总有一天我会的</c.simplifiedchinese>

347
00:22:30,195 --> 00:22:31,863
<c.simplifiedchinese>你在干什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

348
00:22:32,449 --> 00:22:34,243
<c.simplifiedchinese>深山老林的你怎么一个人？</c.simplifiedchinese>

349
00:22:35,205 --> 00:22:36,706
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 别走那条路！</c.simplifiedchinese>

350
00:22:37,292 --> 00:22:40,295
<c.simplifiedchinese>那可是当地人不会靠近的恶魔森林！</c.simplifiedchinese>

351
00:22:40,882 --> 00:22:42,968
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 你没听我说话吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

352
00:22:43,054 --> 00:22:44,389
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂…</c.simplifiedchinese>

353
00:22:47,855 --> 00:22:50,566
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一集 《弥彦的战斗》</c.simplifiedchinese>

